      "text": "robust z (median / MAD)\nSPOT extreme-value threshold,\n  deferred learning\nwinsorised CUSUM\nconformal p-values\n  for degenerate baselines\n-> surprise = -log10 p",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
