      "originalText": "a service is anomalous after\n3 confirmed windows; opens\nwhen >= 2 services are, one\nseverely (surprise >= 8), or\nan entry point's latency,\nerrors or traffic; resolves\nafter 180 s of quiet;\nIDs derive from the data",
