      "text": "WindowSummary streams:\none gRPC bidi stream\nper edge x core",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WindowSummary streams:\none gRPC bidi stream\nper edge x core",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text-gm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 886,
      "height": 148.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#eaf6ff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1202230407,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1258150089,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790807604279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- each summary carries a sequence number within the edge's epoch (its start time)\n- the edge keeps summaries in a bounded outbox (4320 windows: 12 h at 10 s) until every core acks\n- cores ack cumulatively and apply each (edge, epoch, seq) exactly once; a retransmission timer resends\n- a restarted core adopts the first sequence announced in the edge's hello\n- window w is released when every live edge reported w or later, or another edge is 30 s ahead\n  in event time; an edge silent for 120 s of wall time is no longer waited for\n- no consensus, no broker: merging commutes, so cores fed the same summaries agree",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- each summary carries a sequence number within the edge's epoch (its start time)\n- the edge keeps summaries in a bounded outbox (4320 windows: 12 h at 10 s) until every core acks\n- cores ack cumulatively and apply each (edge, epoch, seq) exactly once; a retransmission timer resends\n- a restarted core adopts the first sequence announced in the edge's hello\n- window w is released when every live edge reported w or later, or another edge is 30 s ahead\n  in event time; an edge silent for 120 s of wall time is no longer waited for\n- no consensus, no broker: merging commutes, so cores fed the same summaries agree",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
